    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "During";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The prohibition applies during the act of exporting.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person exports a thing, or enters a thing for export from Australia; and  (b) the thing is a firearm or firearm part; and  (c) the person exports, or enters for export, the firearm or part with the intention of trafficking in the firearm or part; and  (d) exporting the firearm or part was prohibited under the Customs Act 1901 absolutely.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(a) the person exports a thing, or enters a thing for export from Australia;";
